# The MIT License (MIT)

> **🎈 The 5th-Grader Playground Rule:**  
> Think of this software like a giant bucket of building blocks on a friendly school playground.  
> You are free to take these blocks, build whatever cool castle or spaceship you want, share it with your friends, or even sell things made with it!  
> All we ask is that you leave our name tag on the bucket so people know who made the original blocks.

